## Reflection

This project helped me move beyond simply identifying what happened during a cybersecurity incident and think about how an organization can improve its overall security posture afterward.

I found the framework useful because each function approaches the incident from a different perspective. The technical cause of an incident is important, but so are the organization's 
ability to detect abnormal activity, communicate and respond effectively, restore operations, and reduce the likelihood or impact of a similar incident in the future.

It also gave me additional practice documenting security findings and translating technical events into an organized response strategy.

